ed independently by Type and Size, so the cart contains only the garment you choose. The source chart publishes separate dress and cardigan measurements for girls and mothers, and every available variant below maps to one of those fixed rows.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Separate garment choices:</strong> Select Dress or Cardigan by Type for each shopper.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Navy petite floral:</strong> A small-scale print keeps the matching look wearable and photo-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Layer-ready styling:</strong> Wear the dress alone or add the neutral gray cardigan.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini sizing:</strong> Coordinated options span child and mother size ranges.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed variants:</strong> Every listed garment and size comes from the attached source chart.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose Dress or Cardigan, select the matching sizes, and build a Navy Sprig look for mom and mini.</p>",
